 <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/mfnicocicmmlkpjnaffgihfjhdgjkdjg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chrome extension</a> first. It walks you through the rest of the steps. To install the CLI directly (you should not need to do this), use any of these.</p><ul data-component="download-list"><li data-slot="copy-row" data-funnel-copy="extension" data-funnel-method="curl" data-funnel="copy"><span data-slot="method">curl</span><span data-slot="name" data-copy-command="true" translate="no" title="curl -fsSL https://opencode.ai/browse/install | bash">curl -fsSL https://opencode.ai/browse/install | bash</span></li><li data-slot="copy-row" data-funnel-copy="extension" data-funnel-method="pwsh" data-funnel="copy"><span data-slot="method">pwsh</span><span data-slot="name" data-copy-command="true" translate="no" title="irm https://opencode.ai/browse/install.ps1 | iex">irm https://opencode.ai/browse/install.ps1 | iex</span></li><li data-slot="copy-row" data-funnel-copy="extension" data-funnel-method="npm" data-funnel="copy"><span data-slot="method">npm</span><span data-slot="name" data-copy-command="true" translate="no" title="npm install -g @opencode/browse &amp;&amp; browse install">npm install -g @opencode/browse &amp;&amp; browse install</span></li><li data-slot="copy-row" data-funnel-copy="extension" data-funnel-method="bun" data-funnel="copy"><span data-slot="method">bun</span><span data-slot="name" data-copy-command="true" translate="no" title="bun add -g @opencode/browse &amp;&amp; browse install">bun add -g @opencode/browse &amp;&amp; browse install</span></li></ul></div></section><section data-component="block" data-slot="more-from-anomaly"><h2 id="more-from-anomaly" data-component="section-heading" data-slot="label"><span data-slot="heading-copied" aria-live="polite" data-pagefind-ignore=""></span></h2><div data-slot="body"><ul data-component="product-list"><li><span data-slot="text"><span data-slot="name">Hex</span><span data-slot="description">On-device voice dictation for any app.</span></span><a href="https://anoma.ly/hex" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-component="site-button" data-slot="get" aria-label="Learn more about Hex (opens in a new tab)">Learn more<span data-slot="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li><li><span data-slot="text"><span data-slot="name">OpenTunnel</span><span data-slot="description">Public HTTPS URLs for local apps.</span></span><a href="https://opentunnel.xyz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-component="site-button" data-slot="get" aria-label="Learn more about OpenTunnel (opens in a new tab)">Learn more<span data-slot="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li><li><span data-slot="text"><span data-slot="name">OpenTUI</span><span data-slot="description">A library for terminal user interfaces.</span></span><a href="https://opentui.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-component="site-button" data-slot="get" aria-label="Learn more about OpenTUI (opens in a new tab)">Learn more<span data-slot="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li></ul></div></section></div></div>]]></description>
